  "worked_solution": "First, let's add a new column to our table and compute the ratio of pages per minute for each row.\n\n| Minutes ($m$) | Words ($w$) | Words / Minutes |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $1$ | $70$ | $70$ |\n| $3.5$ | $245$ | $70$ |\n| $5$ | $350$ | $70$ |\n\nThe ratio of words per minute is the same for each row. Therefore, there is a proportional relationship between $m$ and $w,$ and the constant of proportionality is $70.$ \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"",
